---
import '../../src/styles/global.css'
---
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Premiere</title>
		<body class="bg-[#234459] m-0 p-0">
		<img src="/banner_premiere.png" class=" w-screen hero-image">
		<div class="bg-[url(/blue.png)] w-screen bg-cover bg-bottom z-20 relative">
		<p class="pt-30 pb-10 italic hover:underline">June 22nd - July 17th, for teens 18 and under</p>
		<p>We all know games you make disappear into the void, played by few then abandoned. <b class="!text-orange-400"> That ends today.</b></p>
		<p class="!text-3xl" >Ship <b class="!text-orange-400">a trailer</b> to <b class="!text-orange-400">your game</b> and we'll ship you x.</p>
		<p class="pb-80">this way, your game will reach more people & you'll get prizes for doing it.</p>

	</div>
	<div class="relative">
	<div class="bg-[url(/yellow.png)] w-screen bg-cover bg-bottom z-10 -top-130 absolute">
		<h1 class="pt-130">How does premiere work?</h1>
		<p class="pb-10">keep track of your hours with <a href="https://hackatime.hackclub.com/">hackatime </a>and <a href="https://lapse.hackclub.com/">lapse.</a> Have questions? send them in #slack-channel.</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center">
		<img class="w-1/4 transition-all duration-100 ease-in-out hover:rotate-6 hover:scale-110 hover:saturate-200" src="/card1.png" alt="build a game of your own, be creative!">
		<img class="w-1/4 transition-all duration-100 ease-in-out hover:-rotate-6 hover:scale-110 hover:saturate-200"src="/card2.png" alt="make a trailer to your game! screen record, animate, etc!">
		<img class="w-1/4 transition-all duration-100 ease-in-out hover:rotate-6 hover:scale-110 hover:saturate-200"src="/card3.png" alt="Publish to Itch.io, Github, and make social media posts!">
		<img class="w-1/4 transition-all duration-100 ease-in-out hover:-rotate-6 hover:scale-110 hover:saturate-200"src="/card4.png" alt="GET FREE STUFF!!!">
		</div>
		<p class="pb-80"></p>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="pt-240 bg-[#6d639c]">
	<div class="relative z-50">
	<h1>Prizes</h1>
	<p>prizes are determined by the quality of your game + trailer & the amount of hours you spent making them.</p>
	<p>image flexbox here... art max..</p>
	<p class="pb-80"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="bg-black w-screen pb-10 pt-10 z-30">
		<p><i>made with <3 by teenagers, for teenagers.</i></p>
		<p><a href="https://hackclub.com/">hack club</a> | <a href="https://hackclub.com/slack"> join our slack</a></p>
	</div>
	</body>